xnu 0415: prove PCIe0 and the QCA6490 endpoint (mondrianwifi=1)

W1 is MMIO only: vote the WLAN/PCIe rails and clocks, load the live-DTB
82-entry PHY table, train PCIe0, open the endpoint config window and read
17cb:1103. Bus mastering is cleared and verified before the worker stops.
There is no SMMU, DMA, MSI, MHI, firmware, ath11k or network interface yet.

Cold-link order ported from qiumochen/UniXNU-zizhan 88f4eeb,
drivers/PongWifi/PongWifiPlatform.cpp (BSD-2-Clause-Patent). The PHY
table is board data from dtb/mondrian-live.dtb. No GPL ath11k or vendor
driver code is included.

